<section class="sec ps-scope" id="payments"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><h2 class="display-l">Know what’s included.<br><span class="serif">Before you begin.</span></h2><p>Each service has its own scope and pricing. The authorisation offer does not apply to every service.</p></div><div class="ps-terms">
<details><summary>FCA authorisation: payments and service scope</summary><div class="ps-terms-body"><% if(c.showPrice){ %><p><%= offer.minimumTotal.explanation %> <%= offer.afterMinimumTerm %> <%= offer.decisionTimingTerms %></p><% } %>        <div class="panel panel--soft">
          <h3 style="font-size:21px;margin:0">Not included</h3>
          <ul class="x-list">
            <li>The FCA application fee, which is paid separately.</li>
            <li>A guarantee of FCA approval, authorisation or application timescales. All decisions remain with the FCA.</li>
            <li>Legal advice.</li>
            <li>CCR009 Return Assistance and Ongoing Motor Dealer Compliance Support, which are separate services with their own scope and pricing.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="fine" style="margin-top:18px">Continuing reporting support is £<%= offer.reportingMonthly %> per month before active referral discounts, which carry on after authorisation.</p>
          <p class="fine" style="margin-top:8px">Responsibility for the accuracy of information supplied, business operations, regulatory decisions and compliance with FCA requirements remains with the applicant firm.</p>
        </div></div></details>
<details><summary>CCR009: scope and responsibilities</summary><div class="ps-terms-body"><p>We help you understand the return and organise the information required. Scope and fees are agreed before engagement. Your firm remains responsible for checking its reporting obligations and making its submission.</p><a class="text-link" href="/ccr009-return-assistance-motor-dealers">See CCR009 service details →</a></div></details>
<details><summary>Ongoing support: fair use and additional work</summary><div class="ps-terms-body">      <div class="panel panel--soft" style="margin-top:20px">
        <h3 style="font-size:19px;margin:0 0 8px">What ongoing support doesn’t cover</h3>
        <p class="muted" style="margin:0 0 8px">Certain work may fall outside the scope of the monthly support fee and would be discussed and agreed in advance before being undertaken. This may include more extensive remediation work following regulatory issues, one-off projects that sit outside the normal scope of ongoing support, or assistance relating to historic matters prior to the start of the engagement.</p>
        <p class="muted" style="margin:0 0 8px">The monthly support fee provides access to compliance support on a fair-use basis and does not guarantee delivery of every service listed. The level, frequency and focus of support may vary depending on client needs and usage.</p>
        <p class="muted" style="margin:0">Any additional work is only carried out once scope, timing and costs have been agreed.</p>
      </div></div></details></div></div></section>
